$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 47. A vial containing freshly dried (130 °C in vacuo, 12 h) CsF (16.1 mg,
106 μmol, 100 equiv) was treated with a solution of 46 (1.7 mg, 1.06
μmol) in anhydrous DMF (178 μL, 0.006 M, dried over activated 4Å
molecular sieves for 12 h) at 25 °C under Ar. The reaction mixture was
allowed to stir for 8 h, diluted with EtOAc (600 μL), and quenched by the
addition of saturated aqueous NH4Cl (600 μL) and the aqueous phase was
extracted with EtOAc (3 × 600 μL). The combined organic phases were
washed sequentially with saturated aqueous NH4Cl (1 × 300 μL), saturated
aqueous NaCl (1 × 300 μL), dried (Na2SO4) and concentrated in vacuo. PTLC
(SiO2, 8 × 8 cm plate, 10% MeOH-CH2Cl2) afforded 47 as a white solid (1.6
mg, 1.6 mg theoretical, 100%). [α]25 D +32 (c 0.02, CH3OH); 1H NMR
(CD3OD, 600 MHz) δ 8.04 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 1H), 7.91 (s, 1H), 7.62 (d, J =
8.3 Hz, 1H), 7.46 (d, J = 8.3 Hz, 1H), 7.28 (s, 1H), 7.23 (d, J = 8.3 Hz,
1H), 7.18 (d, J = 9.2 Hz, 1H), 7.10 (br s, 2H), 7.08 (s, 1H), 7.06 (d, J
= 8.8 Hz, 1H), 7.04 (s, 1H), 6.98 (br s, 2H), 6.96 (d, J = 5.3 Hz, 1H),
6.68 (s, 1H), 6.37 (s, 1H), 6.09 (s, 1H), 5.75 (s, 1H), 5.68 (s, 1H),
5.51 (s, 1H), 5.28 (d, J = 5.3 Hz, 1H), 5.20 (s, 1H), 5.03 (d, J = 5.3
Hz, 1H), 4.78 (s, 2H), 4.66 (s, 1H), 4.61 (s, 2H), 4.38 (m, 1H), 4.12 (s,
3H), 4.07 (m, 2H), 3.93 (m, 2H), 3.91 (s, 3H), 3.79 (s, 3H), 3.74 (s,
3H), 3.73 (m, 1H), 3.72 (s, 3H), 3.59 (m, 2H), 3.42 (s, 3H), 3.38 (s,
3H), 2.08 (s, 3H), 1.47 (s, 9H); IR (neat) νmax 3290, 2925, 2854, 1712,
1696, 1667, 1652, 1605, 1582, 1505, 1463, 1419, 1373, 1322, 1289, 1201,
1175, 1136, 1099, 825, 801 cm-1; MALDIFTMS (DHB) m/z 1485.4953 (M+ + Na,
C74H78N8O24 requires 1485.5021).
