$DATUM 7732-18-5
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM a) 1-[4-(4-ethyl-2-methoxyphenoxy)-3-fluorophenyl]ethanoneTo a suspension
of KOH (2 mmol ; 112 mg) in anhydrous DMF (1 mL) under argon, was added
4-(2- hydroxyethyl)-2-methoxyphenol (0.77 mmol; 130 mg) followed by
1-(3,4-difluorophenyl)ethanone (0.77 mmol; 0.97 ml). The reaction mixture
was stirred at 110°C for 20h. After quenching with NaOH (0,1N ; 3 mL),
the mixture was extracted with ethyl acetate (3*5 mL). Combined organic
phases were dried over Na2SO4, concentrated in vacuum, used without
purification. Light brown oil, yield 244 mg, quantitative. MS (ES) m/e
289 (M+H)+.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective
