$DATUM To a solution of N-BOC 4-fluorophenylsulfone ethyl ester 15 42 (1.5 g,
3.61 mmol) in DMF(10mL) was added Cs2CO3 (2.95 g, 9.03 mmol) and
α,α,α-trifluoro-p- cresol (877 mg, 5.41 mmol). The solution was heated to
90°C for 20 h. The solution was then cooled and partitioned between EtOAc
and water, and the organic layerwas washed with brine and dried over
Na2SO4. Filtration through a pad of silica gel eluting with EtOAc
provided diaryl ether 16p as a yellow oil (2.30 g, 100%). MS(CI) MH+
calcd for C26H30NO7SF3, 558; found, 558.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
