$DATUM To a solution of fluorophenylsulfone 10 42 (2.0 g, 5.2 mmol) in DMAC (6
mL) was added 4-(trifluoromethylthio)thiophenol (1.5 g, 7.8 mmol)
followed by Cs2CO3 (6.8 g, 20.8 mmol). After adding a catalytic amount of
potassium fluoride, the reaction was heated at 95°C for 12 h. The DMAC
was removed in vacuo to afford the diaryl ether 11l as a brown solid (7.2
g, 100%).
