$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM To a solution of fluorophenylsulfone 10 42 (3.1 g, 8.0 mmol) in
DMAC(20mL) was added Cs2CO3 (7.28 g, 24 mmol) and 4-(methylthio)phenol
(2.24 g, 16 mmol). The slurry was stirred at 95°Cfor 24 h. The reaction
was concentrated in vacuo, and the residue was taken up in EtOAc, washed
with brine, dried over Na2SO4, filtered, and concentrated in vacuo.
Chromatography on silica gel eluting with EtOAc/hexanes provided the
diaryl ether 11k as a white foam (4.1 g, 100%). MS (ES+) calcd for
C24H29NO7S2, 208.15; found, 508.15.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
