$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM To a solution of the N-cyclopropyl amine p-fluoro sulfone 22w (6.97 g,
19.6mmol) in DMF (500 mL) was added K2CO3 (3.42 g, 18.0 mmol) and
4-(trifluoromethoxy)-phenol (3.7 g, 24.8mmol).The solution was stirred at
90 °C for 40 h. The mixture was then diluted with H2O (600 mL) and
extracted with EtOAc. The organic layer was washed with water and brine
and dried over MgSO4, filtered, and concentrated invacuo to afford the
desired diaryl ether 20w as an oil (8.5 g, 100%). HRMS MH+ calcd for
C24H26NSO6F3, 514.1511; found, 514.1524.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Orally Active MMP-1 Sparing α-Tetrahydropyranyl and α-Piperidinyl Sulfone
