Kasturi, Jyotsna; Geisler, John G.; Lenhard, James M.; Player, Mark R.;
Gaul, Micheal D.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Medicinal Chemistry (2011), 54(3), 788-808

