$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 6-bromo-5-(2-fluoro-4-nitrophenoxy)-1-methy1H-indazole (2) from 22.
Dimethylformamide (74 L), 22 (10.6 kg, 44.9 mol), sodium bicarbonate
(11.4 kg, 135.4 mol, 3 equiv), and 1,2-difluoro-4-nitrobenzene (8.17 kg,
51.3 mol, 1.14 equiv) were combined and heated to 60 - 65 °C for 15 h.
The mixture was cooled to 25 - 30 °C, before water (265 L) was added,
precipitating the product. The product was filtered, washed with water
(212 L), and dried, resulting in 2. Yield 16.3 kg, 98.1%, 98.9 area%.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective, alternative preparation shown, key intermediate, 49%
overall yield from 6-Bromo-5-methoxy-1H-indazole
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
